SY_TALK("CCLcoVpR_tw",[[2,["With all the Ganapatis sitting around me"]],[7,["and you all the ganas sitting in front of me,"]],[11,["I don’t know what to say."]],[16,["It’s remarkable, very remarkable,"]],[20,["because most of you come from a culture"]],[25,["which has never shown any respect of Shri Ganesh."]],[29,["They never realised how important it was that,"]],[33,["without Shri Ganesha’s qualities,"]],[39,["we cannot achieve anything in our life."]],[46,["The idea of everyday, moment-to-moment enjoyment has destroyed them."]],[55,["And also the desire to know the Divine"]],[69,["vanishes also in the thin air"]],[73,["because you get lost into this moment-to-moment enjoyment"]],[80,["till you get destructive, completely destroyed."]],[85,["But I really don’t understand how you have achieved this state"]],[94,["where you see [that] the purity is so important to life;"]],[99,["that Ganesha’s qualities, His value system"]],[109,["and His innocence are to be imbibed."]],[118,["I feel very gratified that such a thing has happened now in your lives"]],[128,["and you all are so much in praise for Shri Ganesha."]],[137,["Shri Ganesha is there from our childhood."]],[143,["Yesterday you saw the children, how they were so beautiful"]],[147,["and entertained us the most."]],[149,["Everybody had a smile on their face and I said,"]],[153,["“Don’t laugh,” because if you laugh they feel a little offended"]],[158,["and they think that you are laughing at them."]],[165,["The enjoyment that we had from that drama of children"]],[173,["was more than what one would expect"]],[179,["from adults doing that kind of a drama just to entertain us."]],[185,["It might be some sort of a very subtle joy of Shri Ganesha"]],[191,["that made us so happy."]],[194,["We all have Shri Ganesh settled very nicely within ourselves"]],[200,["and, in you, awakened; awakened in such a manner"]],[207,["that, in your free will also, you do not want to do things"]],[213,["that will go against Shri Ganesha."]],[218,["His manifestation within you is so evident."]],[223,["you see your faces – they are so beautifully shining,"]],[229,["so very different from other people."]],[232,["One day I was travelling from London"]],[236,["and there was one Indian lady who came to see me and she said,"]],[242,["“I was surprised to see your disciples. Their faces were shining"]],[248,["with such light. I have never seen any disciples like that.”"]],[256,["I asked her, “Who are you?”"]],[261,["She said, “I am married in Guru Nanak’s family"]],[265,["and all the people in his family are just the opposite"]],[271,["[of] what Guru Nanak was.”"]],[276,["So I said, “Because they worship Shri Ganesha.”"]],[281,["So she said that, “In our family nobody worships Shri Ganesh.”"]],[287,["I said, “It cannot be possible! How is it?”"]],[291,["They believe in nirakar, in the formless God of chaitanya."]],[300,["I said, “But who is the source of that chaitanya?"]],[304,["Why don’t they find out who is the source?”"]],[307,["So they said that Nanaka has only talked up to this point."]],[312,["He’s not talked about the source."]],[318,["I said, “Better find out,"]],[322,["because in this book maybe some things have been taken away.”"]],[327,["And then somebody gave me a passage where he had described"]],[332,["the innocence, the Deity of Shri Ganesha also."]],[337,["He had described that the whole Creation was done by the Mother"]],[344,["and not by the Father."]],[346,["It’s very surprising because nirakaris,"]],[349,["those people, who don’t believe in the forms of God,"]],[355,["always talk of Father, not of the Mother."]],[358,["It is true also about Christianity, also about Islam,"]],[370,["also about the Jews."]],[376,["All of them, they talk of the Father and not of the Mother,"]],[382,["nor about Shri Ganesh."]],[386,["It seems, in the ancient times they believed in child God,"]],[393,["even in China, even in Greece and also in many other countries"]],[401,["who were supposed to be primitive. But they all believed in the child God."]],[410,["So now, when we deal with our children,"]],[414,["we should know that they are just like Shri Ganesh:"]],[421,["they are very innocent, very simple;"]],[425,["except in cases sometimes [where] they are affected by some things"]],[431,["and they lose their moorings."]],[438,["But Shri Ganesha’s greatest contribution to Sahaja Yoga is"]],[445,["that He makes you feel My vibrations."]],[450,["He makes you feel the beauty of purity and simplicity."]],[458,["[It’s] only possible if Shri Ganesha is awakened within you."]],[464,["Also the Kundalini won’t rise without the sanction of this ‘chancellor’."]],[470,["He’s the one sitting on Mooladhara."]],[474,["But you should know He is on every chakra."]],[479,["Innocence cures all the maladies, physical, mental, emotional,"]],[488,["specially the spiritual one."]],[492,["But Shri Ganesha’s quality, the most important, is"]],[498,["that He believes in emitting vibrations,"]],[503,["He believes in projecting His vibrations to everyone."]],[511,["That is the quality now [that] I feel all of you, as Sahaja Yogis, can use."]],[521,["You got your Realisation without any effort I should say."]],[528,["It was Sahaj."]],[531,["The life before Self-realisation was different."]],[537,["You got your transformation"]],[540,["and you have jumped into the new era of Meta Science."]],[551,["But here now we have to see"]],[553,["whatever we have got, what are we to do with it?"]],[559,["You, of course, know that you have to give Realisations to others,"]],[564,["you have to cure people, you have to love them"]],[572,["and you have to be compassionate"]],[575,["but apart from that, now the deliberations about yourself have to start."]],[583,["That is through Shri Ganesha’s powers that are within you."]],[588,["You should see that you can emit your powers your energy to others."]],[597,["You can project it to others."]],[600,["Now, for example, If somebody comes to you, meets you,"]],[609,["if you know how to deliberately project your energy."]],[616,["This is a new type of meditation you have to practise now:"]],[621,["that to emit your energy, project your energy to others."]],[625,["You don’t have to say anything, you don’t have to talk"]],[629,["but just feel deliberately – again I say deliberately."]],[634,["It’s not sahaj, it’s not spontaneous."]],[637,["This is what you have to practise,"]],[639,["is to emit your energy of your innocence of Shri Ganesha to others"]],[646,["so, when they see you, their innocence would be awakened."]],[652,["Now, for example, say"]],[659,["we had some problems in London and Sahaj Yogis told me,"]],[665,["“Mother, there are still some men are looking at us.”"]],[669,["And some said that, “There are many women who are looking at us.”"]],[675,["It was a mutual sort of a thing going on."]],[680,["I said, “You can project your energy in such a manner"]],[689,["that that projection will stop all this kind of stupid behaviour of other people"]],[696,["and also make them understand, respect you and feel your dignity.”"]],[704,["Not very difficult."]],[706,["But, on the contrary, as the culture is"]],[711,["to attract men and attract women it will diminish."]],[719,["The energy will diminish."]],[722,["When you feel your own dignity and serenity"]],[731,["and [realise] that you are now Self-realised people,"]],[737,["you are not ordinary people"]],[739,["a kind of majestic personality develops within you."]],[745,["That majestic personality really can have a tremendous effect"]],[754,["on the surrounding people – tremendous!"]],[759,["It’s a kind of a deliberate projection you should start."]],[763,["I don’t know that side, that how to project it"]],[769,["or how to deliberately do this."]],[772,["It’s just spontaneous with me, it just happens."]],[776,["But you can achieve it yourself with [a] little practice."]],[779,["Try to face such people, not with disdain or contempt,"]],[792,["but just your majestic personality."]],[797,["This personality is here now, you see,"]],[801,["is sitting in such a majestic manner"]],[806,["and is also giving the vibrations to others."]],[813,["The whole figure is doing something suddenly to people."]],[824,["To expect that the whole world will change spontaneously,"]],[829,["I don’t think is alright."]],[833,["Because, you know, the world is so chaotic, full of so much chaos,"]],[838,["so much ego, so much conditioning."]],[842,["But something within you can rise above others"]],[850,["with your sense of dignity, with your complete Selfhood,"]],[860,["where you stand with yourself."]],[863,["You are not to be rude, you are not to be egoistical,"]],[867,["you need not say things if you don’t want to say anything."]],[872,["Just that silent personality can emit such beautiful vibrations,"]],[880,["which you have. You have stored up a lot of vibrations within yourself."]],[885,["And this storing up is showing on your faces, which I said are shining."]],[892,["But the innocence that you have,"]],[896,["you have to be proud of it, very much proud of it."]],[901,["Even now sometimes you feel that people will say"]],[909,["you are not properly dressed up"]],[913,["or maybe you are ugly looking or all kinds of things"]],[916,["that they expect every other person to be."]],[919,["It’s a funny thing that in this world"]],[923,["all human beings expect others to be very good."]],[926,["Everybody should be a hero or something"]],[929,["– what about themselves they never think!"]],[931,["So now you have become heroes in the sense that"]],[935,["spiritually you are much higher than all of them."]],[939,["So this projection, when it starts – I am saying again ‘deliberate’ –"]],[944,["then you should not be afraid that, “I will develop my ego.”"]],[949,["You should not be afraid that, “I’ll get some conditionings.”"]],[953,["But just, in the way, with the understanding,"]],[958,["that you have these powers within you, beautifully expressing themselves,"]],[964,["as a child does."]],[967,["If there is one child, it can entertain at least hundred people."]],[973,["What is so sweet about the child? Is the innocence:"]],[977,["the way he speaks, the way he talks, the way he behaves,"]],[983,["the way he expresses his love. It’s so simple"]],[987,["but it has something in the essence, this innocence of Shri Ganesha."]],[996,["Anywhere there’s a question of children,"]],[1002,["the whole world get worried about it,"]],[1006,["the whole world wants to solve the problem."]],[1010,["If a child is in trouble, anywhere all over the world"]],[1017,["it will be circulated that such and such a thing is happening"]],[1021,["to such a child and everybody will be worried."]],[1025,["If they see a child anywhere, the faces change;"]],[1031,["you see the faces, the expression changes, automatically."]],[1035,["Because that child is emitting that innocence;"]],[1040,["without any deliberations, without any special way of doing it,"]],[1049,["but just spontaneously."]],[1052,["But then you grow, you start growing, growing with others"]],[1059,["who are also not innocent. You have to meet them."]],[1063,["You can’t run away from the society."]],[1066,["You start getting all the rapport with such people"]],[1075,["who are talking about things"]],[1079,["– actually, those who are criticising Shri Ganesha."]],[1083,["Gradually, your innocence starts dying out"]],[1089,["and you feel sometimes inferior to all those"]],[1093,["who are supposed to be very great warriors against innocence."]],[1100,["In the sense that – when I was in London"]],[1107,["I saw they all used to laugh at me because I had this kumkum."]],[1112,["But I used to think they don’t know why I am wearing it."]],[1116,["So, it’s so ignorant they are:"]],[1118,["very ignorant people that they don’t know in India"]],[1122,["all the married women have to wear this."]],[1125,["Even the Muslims wear that; they also wear mangalsutra."]],[1130,["So I said that,"]],[1132,["“This is just written down, on my head, that I am a married woman.”"]],[1137,["It’s just to tell people ‘don’t bother me."]],[1140,["I have got my husband behind me and he can take you to task.’"]],[1147,["This kind of ignorance is so much in the West"]],[1153,["and still they think they are a higher race, they are greater people."]],[1158,["They don’t know even small, small things about life."]],[1163,["For the innocence, I think"]],[1166,["they have lost any knowledge about it, long time back."]],[1174,["And that’s how it is a society, today,"]],[1178,["which has absolutely lost its own moorings."]],[1184,["Every individual is separate,"]],[1186,["every individual is doing something and they don’t know each other."]],[1191,["Without innocence you cannot have a rapport with other people."]],[1197,["Because that means you have some sort of a lust"]],[1201,["or greed behind the whole thing."]],[1205,["So much so now, it’s become so boring the whole thing,"]],[1211,["that even once I told this Sahaj Yogi that, if you are going there,"]],[1216,["there’s a family and they have a daughter,"]],[1220,["so just give this present to her – a simple thing!"]],[1226,["Now this yogi was quite an elderly person, not a young boy."]],[1231,["He said, “Mother, I’d better not go.” I said, “Why?”"]],[1234,["“Because they will misunderstand me.”"]],[1237,["“What will they misunderstand?”"]],[1239,["“Why am I giving a present to this girl?”"]],[1243,["I said, “But it’s I am giving. What is the harm?”"]],[1246,["“No!” That’s the psychology. He was himself a psychologist."]],[1250,["That’s the psychology. “So I cannot take this present for that girl!”"]],[1254,["I mean, I was [amazed]: for Indians, you don’t understand this kind of a fear."]],[1259,["But then I noticed it’s too much"]],[1262,["that they don’t want to be with any woman,"]],[1266,["they don’t want to be alone with any woman."]],[1269,["And they said Mother, “You don’t know these women!"]],[1273,["They will make a rape case out of us!” “But how?”"]],[1276,["“They do!” So the whole idea is to challenge the innocence of people."]],[1286,["For that, I must say, they made this Freud into a god"]],[1293,["because of his writings. I don’t know how they accept, also, such writings."]],[1299,["I just can’t understand how they accept."]],[1301,["Because I think they have no idea as to what they are."]],[1307,["Somebody asked me about Freud, “Then what did he say?"]],[1311,["Why are people so much against him? Why are you so against?”"]],[1315,["I said, “He said that there’s a bad relationship between the mother and the son.”"]],[1320,["He just jumped. “He said so? My goodness! Thank God he never came to India,"]],[1326,["otherwise we would have cut him into pieces and put them in the Indian Sea!”"]],[1331,["I said, “But why spoil the purity of Indian Sea also?”"]],[1338,["He was so annoyed and angry, he said,"]],[1341,["“How could they tolerate such a nonsense?"]],[1344,["How could they accept such nonsense against the mother?"]],[1347,["They have no purity?” I said, “That’s the trouble with them.”"]],[1352,["Now the trouble is that the brain developed too much,"]],[1355,["ego developed too much and any such stupid idea"]],[1360,["– it’s much worse than stupid – was accepted."]],[1365,["And that is how I find it’s so boring:"]],[1369,["every time anywhere you go it’s nothing but this sex business."]],[1378,["It’s too much. I can’t understand how people go on tolerating."]],[1382,["It’s alright, at the most, in some adult films you might show some nonsense,"]],[1388,["but every time you see something you find"]],[1392,["suddenly this kind of nonsensical scene is coming,"]],[1396,["this bedroom scenes, these scenes, and people like it."]],[1400,["They pay for it. They want to have all aspects of it."]],[1408,["It is such a natural thing. What is there to talk about it all the time?"]],[1414,["I don’t understand."]],[1416,["It’s only the development of the brain, of such a manner,"]],[1420,["that every kind of nonsense it wants to accept."]],[1424,["“So what? What’s wrong?”"]],[1426,["“Well, you’re mad! That’s what. You go to lunatic asylum.”"]],[1430,["Lunatics also talk like that. “So what’s wrong?”"]],[1433,["Same way. Because of such acceptance, they don’t know how much"]],[1439,["people have ruined their family life, their children’s life."]],[1444,["In every way, we find that the whole society is full of this nonsense"]],[1450,["and specially in the television – Italy specially."]],[1455,["I mean, certain buttons you should not press,"]],[1462,["you should be very careful,"]],[1463,["otherwise you don’t know what you face and you go for vomiting."]],[1466,["You see, as Indians – first reaction is to vomit."]],[1472,["But for people who have not yet realized the value of this innocence"]],[1481,["can be easily taken up by this kind of nonsense that’s going on."]],[1490,["Whatever it is, through the blessings of Shri Ganesha,"]],[1494,["you are all transformed. You are on a different line."]],[1502,["Yesterday these two musicians were surprised how you were praising Ganesha."]],[1508,["They couldn’t believe it, how you could praise Shri Ganesh,"]],[1512,["because you haven’t even heard the name of Shri Ganesha before"]],[1516,["I said, “They see what Shri Ganesha has done to them,"]],[1521,["how He has made their attention so beautiful"]],[1526,["that they enjoy all the beautiful things of the world,"]],[1531,["all the innocent things of the world.”"]],[1534,["And there are many people like them, I can tell you, who are struggling."]],[1539,["Not that all the society has accepted this nonsense."]],[1542,["There are many who are struggling"]],[1544,["because I know in England they published a book about what children have to say"]],[1550,["about the politicians: very sweet, sweet things, very sweet."]],[1554,["And those books [that] were published were five thousand books because"]],[1557,["if you publish five thousand, you get it cheaper or something like that."]],[1561,["And in one day all the books were sold out – in one day."]],[1567,["That shows that there are so many people still"]],[1571,["who are respecting their innocence and they want to be innocent"]],[1577,["and they want to enjoy it."]],[1579,["But a society has to be created of that kind."]],[1582,["For that, you must have a kind of a personality."]],[1588,["You know that I was in London and once I went to Greece."]],[1595,["And the ministers’ wives also came to meet me."]],[1598,["I was surprised. Normally they don’t do. So they said,"]],[1601,["“You see, our husbands told us if you want to see serenity personified,"]],[1607,["then you must see Mrs. Shrivastava.”"]],[1611,["I was surprised [that] in Greece they are talking of serenity!"]],[1615,["In these modern times anybody talking about purity!"]],[1620,["I just couldn’t understand, but I felt at the back of their mind"]],[1624,["their tradition, whatever it is, these men could see"]],[1631,["that simple thing in me and they went and told them."]],[1634,["And they all enjoyed my company very much."]],[1637,["I was making them laugh and telling them things and all that."]],[1640,["And one of them then turned around and said,"]],[1643,["“Mrs. Shrivastava, you are just like a child!” “I said, “Really?”"]],[1646,["“No, we enjoyed your company so much!”"]],[1648,["And when I was coming, they were in tears."]],[1651,["So what I am saying that: whatever innocent personality you have,"]],[1657,["you have to project now, to project towards others."]],[1660,["Say somebody is trying to be funny with you"]],[1664,["just with one glance you can put that person right,"]],[1667,["that you don’t like it. Just to say you don’t like it."]],[1673,["In a way that’s a projection."]],[1677,["Around your society, around where you are working,"]],[1681,["you will also find people who have no sense of innocence."]],[1686,["And it’s disgusting to be with them."]],[1690,["But as you have powers, you must use [them] – is to project."]],[1695,["I see with Sahaja Yogis, they don’t even cure people."]],[1699,["They’ll tell me, “Mother, he is to be cured. That is to be done.”"]],[1703,["But you are so many, why do you need me to do that now?"]],[1707,["You all can cure a patient. You can help the patient."]],[1711,["Why can’t you do it? What is the need for me to do it?"]],[1715,["You have those qualities within you"]],[1719,["because potentially you had them before"]],[1722,["and now they are enlightened through the grace of Shri Ganesha."]],[1727,["Now, what you have to do is to assert them."]],[1732,["In that, of course, you must remember not to use your ego,"]],[1738,["not to use your mind. So somebody would say that,"]],[1743,["“Mother, without mind how can you impress others?"]],[1747,["How can you have a rapport with others?” It’s very simple."]],[1751,["Just go thoughtless. Once you are thoughtless,"]],[1755,["you are in the Realm of the Divine, and then the Divine takes charge."]],[1761,["And it will start emitting such beautiful vibrations"]],[1765,["that you will be amazed at yourself how things are working out."]],[1770,["It is not a coincidence we should say."]],[1774,["Like once I was going somewhere and they told me that,"]],[1779,["“You have to be very careful!” I said, “Why?”"]],[1783,["“Because in the night, you see, these Naxalites (Indian communists) are here"]],[1787,["and they might just kill you.” I said, “It’s alright!”"]],[1790,["He said, “No, it’s very late. You be careful!”"]],[1795,["So, the gentleman with me was very much worried."]],[1798,["He said, “You take out your ornaments, everything.”"]],[1800,["He put them under the seat and did all that."]],[1805,["So, as soon as we reached that place where many Naxalites were standing"]],[1811,["with their lanterns and with their sticks,"]],[1816,["so I told the driver that, “For one minute you stop the car.”"]],[1820,["He said, “No, I will not!” “No, you stop!”"]],[1823,["I looked at them and I don’t know what happened – they just moved on."]],[1828,["I said, “Now speed up the car.”"]],[1831,["You see, it is the power that you have."]],[1833,["Unless and until you use this power of love and compassion,"]],[1838,["you will not know what you have got. And that comes from your Shri Ganesh."]],[1846,["You see, how children understand love."]],[1850,["If you are nice to them, how they react. Maybe sometimes they do not,"]],[1855,["but ninety-nine percent [of] children, I have seen, they really react to love."]],[1862,["In our school in Dharamsala there were two children"]],[1867,["and they were very troublesome to begin with"]],[1871,["and the parents were worried about them."]],[1874,["They sent them to Dharamsala"]],[1878,["and otherwise they were very demanding as the modern children are."]],[1882,["“You buy this. You buy that. Go here. We want MacDonald!”"]],[1886,["This, that was going on. When they went to the school for one year,"]],[1890,["they came back and the parents asked them,"]],[1893,["“Now, what do you want?” They said, “We don’t want anything!”"]],[1896,["“You don’t want anything? You want to go to MacDonald’s?”"]],[1899,["They were American. “No, no, we don’t want to go to MacDonald."]],[1902,["We want to sit here and watch Mother’s videos.”"]],[1909,["They said, “Suddenly, what has happened to them? They were so troublesome."]],[1912,["Why are they now so much changed? What’s the matter with them?”"]],[1917,["So then they said, “What about food? Whatever you cook, we’ll eat."]],[1921,["We are not bothered.”"]],[1922,["And they were amazed how these children had changed!"]],[1925,["But then they said, “We must go out somewhere."]],[1928,["We must see the river, we must see the mountain.”"]],[1930,["“Alright, that we’ll do.” Then again they came home"]],[1934,["– no demands, nothing. They didn’t want to go for any shopping"]],[1938,["or asking for any shirts or blouse or nothing."]],[1942,["Very much satisfied, dignified."]],[1949,["So they said, “What’s the matter with you? You don’t want anything?”"]],[1953,["“No we want something but we don’t know how to tell you.”"]],[1956,["“What is it?” “Because you don’t have that."]],[1959,["You can’t get it in the market.” “Well, what is it?”"]],[1962,["They said, “Can you get us a pendant of Shri Mataji?”"]],[1966,["So sweetly, you know, they said. That’s all."]],[1970,["But they said, “You don’t have?” “No, we don’t have any.”"]],[1973,["“So you just get us the pendant of Shri Mataji, that’s all.”"]],[1977,["I mean so deep expression. You don’t want anything else."]],[1985,["I mean, I know the children, I have met them,"]],[1988,["but I have not been with them for a long time,"]],[1991,["I have never been so close to them, nothing,"]],[1993,["but look at the love that they have."]],[1998,["And they were telling me in the school in the beginning"]],[2001,["that anybody goes to trouble us, we said,"]],[2004,["“Now we are going to inform Shri Mataji!”"]],[2007,["“No, no, no, don’t inform Her.” “Why?”"]],[2010,["“Because She will not love me any more!” Can you imagine?"]],[2014,["The value of my love is so much understood by these little, little children"]],[2021,["and so much they admire, they want it."]],[2028,["It has no material gain by that, nothing."]],[2034,["All this really shows that Christ as He has said it, that,"]],[2039,["“You have to be like small children to enter into the Kingdom of God.”"]],[2043,["Without that, you cannot enjoy anything."]],[2046,["Like yesterday’s programme was really, I must say"]],[2050,["– these Swiss have worked very hard."]],[2052,["They are very hard working I know, but not to this extent"]],[2055,["that they started singing Indian music so well in such a combination"]],[2062,["and we enjoyed all that very much."]],[2065,["Now imagine these Swiss who are overactive, always working,"]],[2073,["they have no time to think about creating something innocent,"]],[2079,["creating something sweet of this kind."]],[2084,["And the way they did it shows, really, that they love Shri Ganesha"]],[2089,["and they understand the value of Shri Ganesha’s manifestation in them."]],[2096,["I was really surprised how they could learn all this Indian music"]],[2101,["and so many sitting together and singing that song."]],[2105,["And there were some Indians, I said, “Can you sing like this?”"]],[2108,["They said, “No.” I said, “Look at these Swiss.”"]],[2111,["This is the power of Shri Ganesha’s love."]],[2115,["Because they were to celebrate Shri Ganesha’s birthday,"]],[2120,["so they got equipped from within."]],[2125,["But if they had not projected it there would have been nothing."]],[2129,["So whatever He is giving you, whatever He is creating in you,"]],[2133,["this beautiful innocence, this beautiful fragrance of your living,"]],[2141,["every moment, when you are enjoying it,"]],[2144,["also know that we have to give it to others."]],[2147,["We have to pour this into others."]],[2151,["And it will work out, I know it will work out."]],[2155,["It is so tremendous. His powers are so tremendous."]],[2159,["Yesterday you saw that in the children’s program"]],[2164,["that nobody could beat him, even Shiva, anyone."]],[2169,["And Shiva had to cut His head"]],[2173,["because He didn’t know how to overpower Him otherwise."]],[2178,["This is what we have to understand, that if you are innocent,"]],[2184,["nobody can cheat us, nobody can trouble us,"]],[2188,["because in innocence you become a person"]],[2193,["who doesn’t care for what is happening to you."]],[2196,["You become a person who tolerates everything thinking these are…"]],[2201,["you don’t even think, you feel they are something, stupid people, that’s all."]],[2207,["It is a story about a king in China, as I am going to China."]],[2213,["There was a king in China."]],[2215,["They are very wise people, I must say Chinese are extremely wise."]],[2219,["And he decided to win a cocks’ fight. It’s a cocks’ fight."]],[2229,["Imagine the king thinking like that! But it’s all child’s play."]],[2234,["So he went to one great saint and told him that,"]],[2237,["“How will you train a cock to fight the other cocks?”"]],[2243,["He said, “Leave the cock with me.”"]],[2245,["So he left the cock there and he trained him very well"]],[2251,["because when the king arrived after one month before the fight,"]],[2255,["he said, “See now, take this cock it’s your one.”"]],[2258,["He said, “This one? This one is not doing anything, just standing straight."]],[2262,["He said, “Yes, yes. That’s it. You take it.”"]],[2266,["So he took that cock and put him in that contest."]],[2274,["So all the cocks were together."]],[2278,["They started troubling this cock, which was just standing like this as if,"]],[2282,["“Some stupid people are trying to trouble me.”"]],[2286,["He wouldn’t touch them, he wouldn’t react, nothing of the kind,"]],[2289,["he was just standing straight."]],[2291,["So all the cocks were surprised that, “This one is not protesting."]],[2296,["He’s just bearing up everything and he’s not bothered as to what we are doing.”"]],[2301,["One by one all the cocks disappeared from the field"]],[2306,["where they were having these fights."]],[2309,["And this was the only cock which stood up."]],[2314,["So the king was surprised. He took him to the saint and he said,"]],[2320,["“This one has become a saint now. So it’s better you keep it with you!”"]],[2324,["He’s such a saint that they were all trying to trouble him and he was least bothered."]],[2329,["He was looking like this, left side, right side, both sides."]],[2332,["He thought, “What’s going on with these people? Why are they behaving like this?”"]],[2336,["So this is what I have to tell you that your personality itself"]],[2341,["is made like that and now you worship Him so much [that] He’s within you."]],[2347,["And any kind of problems that you have will be really solved very easily"]],[2357,["if you take to your innocence."]],[2360,["And that will create coincidences, as they call it."]],[2365,["But I would say it’s not coincidence, it’s the vibrations."]],[2371,["And you’ll be amazed how things are solved."]],[2375,["They’ll say, “Mother, this had happened, that had happened.”"]],[2377,["Now see, the other day, it rained so much."]],[2380,["It rained so much so that they said,"]],[2382,["“It has become knee-deep mud here and Mother what are we to do?”"]],[2387,["I said, “It’s alright. Leave it to Him.”"]],[2390,["Next day it was very hot. Imagine underneath these things,"]],[2395,["the whole thing got dried out and today you are here for the puja."]],[2402,["It’s an impossible thing that there could be such a change in the weather"]],[2409,["that one day it rains so heavily and second day"]],[2414,["the whole thing gets absolutely dried out."]],[2418,["It’s His work, because He’s so much powerful."]],[2424,["You have come to worship Him, so first of all cleansing has to be done"]],[2430,["and He did the cleansing by putting the rain here."]],[2435,["It’s so heavy rains and some of the part of the rains"]],[2440,["which came near this Palazzo Dorio they turned into ice (hail)."]],[2454,["I don’t know what is English word is [for] that."]],[2456,["So they all started and the whole thing went round the house."]],[2462,["They were all forming into little, little ice-balls, falling nearby."]],[2469,["Now it is something unbelievable that all over it has just rained"]],[2475,["only near our house it is the ice-balls are coming."]],[2478,["We can call it ‘miracles’, we can call it anything,"]],[2482,["but it is Shri Ganesha’s, we should say, sensitivity"]],[2487,["that He thought that, “Now this rain is going near my Mother’s house,"]],[2492,["so let us make some sort of a beautiful ice-balls.”"]],[2497,["And I went out and I saw, and I was amazed"]],[2500,["how it was all around my house [that] there were ice-balls."]],[2505,["What He can do, what he’s capable is absolutely unbelievable."]],[2513,["How He guides you and how He helps you."]],[2516,["How He takes you to [the] right path."]],[2519,["Not only that [but] how He protects you."]],[2521,["All the time He is with you because you have become His ganas now."]],[2527,["You are His ganas, so He protects you, looks after you,"]],[2531,["gives you all the guidance. He takes you to the right path."]],[2536,["He takes you to the righteous road."]],[2541,["He gives you all that is dharmic to enjoy."]],[2545,["You always meet friends here and there."]],[2548,["You think it’s a coincidence – it is not."]],[2550,["And that is how He works."]],[2553,["He works with all His beautiful, sweet, loving attention on you"]],[2562,["because you are His ganas."]],[2565,["But the ganas have to work!"]],[2569,["As I say that, in our body there are ganas"]],[2575,["and they fight the disease, they fight the problems that are in the body"]],[2583,["those antibodies which are the ganas of Shri Ganesha."]],[2590,["In the same way, you are also His ganas."]],[2593,["He does all this for you. He protects you, He loves you,"]],[2596,["He gives you all the good time."]],[2600,["Then what are we doing about it?"]],[2602,["It should not be one-sided. When He does all this for you"]],[2608,["then what should we do about Shri Ganesh?"]],[2612,["What can we do as antibodies?"]],[2616,["You don’t have to fight the enemies with any sword or any kind of a weapon."]],[2628,["The enemies you can conquer by simple, two, methods."]],[2635,["One is try your love, your pure love on them. Try that."]],[2642,["You may melt away many people."]],[2644,["Or else, if that is not working, then what should you do"]],[2651,["is to sit down and meditate and give bandhans."]],[2656,["There are ways of giving bandhans. The bandhan works so fast"]],[2660,["and so beautifully that you are amazed how it has worked!"]],[2665,["Because you are so powerful."]],[2668,["The way you give bandhan, [if] anybody else can give"]],[2671,["it is not going to work! It’s only you, the Sahaj Yogis, can give bandhan."]],[2676,["There are different types of bandhans you have to give."]],[2680,["And all that works out so well."]],[2684,["So we have to have now faith in our own powers"]],[2688,["and we have to know that we are now empowered by Shri Ganesha"]],[2694,["to do the work of Sahaja Yoga."]],[2697,["To do the work of Sahaja Yoga is not to feel that you are doing it,"]],[2702,["but it is Shri Ganesh who is doing it."]],[2706,["You will be surprised – giving Realisations to people"]],[2710,["is the greatest joy Sahaja Yogis can have."]],[2714,["And then you don’t have to think that you have done it"]],[2718,["– then is the best – but if you think you have done it then,"]],[2722,["“I am very tired,” or “I have done this!”"]],[2725,["Many people come and tell me, “Mother, we have done this, we have done that!”"]],[2730,["That means they are just feeling the strain of doing any work."]],[2736,["But you are not to feel any strain."]],[2739,["His powers are within you, you can see it. Believe me!"]],[2744,["Believe in yourself. Have confidence in yourself"]],[2747,["– confidence and faith in yourself."]],[2749,["And [know] that you are a storehouse of innocence"]],[2754,["which is nothing but compassion and love."]],[2759,["If you have that faith"]],[2761,["you will definitely develop a beautiful way of talking to others,"]],[2768,["of having [a] relationship with others."]],[2778,["It is something that is really a gift of Shri Ganesh."]],[2786,["I don’t think I every shouted at anyone."]],[2791,["Even on my children, I have never shouted, never."]],[2795,["I have never got into a fury or a temper"]],[2798,["because I think I can manage without it."]],[2800,["Of course, I had to correct, I had to tell people."]],[2804,["But one thing I have seen [is] that everybody has been afraid of one thing"]],[2810,["– that somehow I should never drive out somebody from Sahaja Yoga,"]],[2814,["because Sahaja Yoga is such a joy,"]],[2817,["it is such an energy-giving thing,"]],[2820,["it is such a light that you feel absolutely confident about yourself."]],[2831,["So to ask you to leave Sahaja Yoga"]],[2834,["is the greatest punishment because you can’t leave me now."]],[2840,["It’s difficult. You just can’t leave me! It’s impossible!"]],[2845,["And that is what it is that you also develop those qualities"]],[2849,["that you can’t leave."]],[2852,["See, a child, if it is lost, I mean, the parents just go off,"]],[2857,["they don’t know how the child is lost."]],[2860,["But supposing, some son of theirs is a very bad boy,"]],[2866,["is misbehaving, is doing all kinds of wrong things, they don’t mind."]],[2872,["But when they are young, they are innocent"]],[2874,["it’s some sort of a tremendous attachment to them"]],[2879,["and understanding that “They are our children, we have to look after them.”"]],[2885,["So [it’s] this innocence that attracts you,"]],[2889,["that keeps you wondering about your children, about other children."]],[2895,["And I was very happy the way you gave a present to Guido"]],[2900,["because he’s doing a very difficult task, I must say."]],[2904,["And this appreciation shows that to you it’s very valuable"]],[2910,["that your children are looked after."]],[2913,["But you are also a child of your Mother."]],[2916,["As a result, you have all these powers within yourself."]],[2921,["But you must know how to smile. You must know how to win over people."]],[2927,["Still there are some Sahaj Yogis and some Sahaj Yoginis"]],[2931,["who are still rather stiff! I find them little stiff type"]],[2936,["and they can’t give up their stiffness."]],[2938,["Maybe they think no end of themselves or whatever it is."]],[2941,["Then they will not enjoy Sahaja Yoga."]],[2943,["Of course, mentally of course they understand Sahaj Yog and all that"]],[2947,["but they cannot enjoy fully Sahaj Yoga and all its mirth, its joyous moments."]],[2956,["Today is to celebrate His birth"]],[2961,["and He was the first God that was created on this Earth;"]],[2966,["because he’s also auspiciousness, he’s also Holiness."]],[2973,["So the Primordial Mother didn’t want to create this world"]],[2978,["without first creating the holiness, the auspiciousness, the purity."]],[2985,["And that’s why He was first created."]],[2989,["Created on this Earth with vibrations, just [a] bundle of vibrations:"]],[2994,["so that He can look after all the people"]],[2998,["who are going to come from ages to ages,"]],[3006,["to guide them always on the right path."]],[3011,["So He is supposed to be in charge of our conscience,"]],[3016,["the conscience that eats you up sometimes, that says,"]],[3020,["“This is not alright. This I should not have done."]],[3023,["That I should have not done.”"]],[3025,["But one should try to take very great pride in it."]],[3030,["Like there was one gentleman, an Indian"]],[3034,["– Indians can be exceptionally innocent sometimes, exceptionally,"]],[3037,["you can’t understand them! So I told him,"]],[3041,["“Why did you give up your land?”"]],[3045,["He said, “Mother, I thought that later on, when my children will grow,"]],[3049,["I might become greedy and I may not give this land to my brother,"]],[3054,["who deserves it because I’m too clever, I can cheat him."]],[3058,["So I thought it’s better to give up."]],[3060,["So I gave up the land to my brother.”"]],[3062,["And he so innocently was telling me that,"]],[3067,["“I should not become greedy because maybe that my children will grow up"]],[3073,["and I will feel that I must give all this to my children,"]],[3076,["so I decided to give up the land just now to my own brother.”"]],[3080,["But I said, “What about your brother?”"]],[3082,["He said, “He deserves, he needs. I don’t need so much land."]],[3086,["I am doing very well in life. That’s why I have given.”"]],[3089,["“But legally?” “Legally,” he said, “it was not in his name,"]],[3094,["but I thought it’s better that I give it to him now."]],[3097,["Later on I might become a bad man.”"]],[3100,["So the innocence works out in such a manner."]],[3103,["And very sweet, sweet stories I have got to tell you."]],[3106,["There’s one Sahaj Yogi who was a little boy, say about sixteen years of old,"]],[3111,["he came to me and he said, “My mother has some badhas and the father, too."]],[3115,["I don’t know what to do."]],[3117,["Now supposing I leave my father and mother,"]],[3120,["then will the badhas also leave me?” I said, “Maybe. May not be. Depends on…”"]],[3127,["“Then what is the need for people to leave their parents"]],[3130,["when they are eighteen years of age? Why do people leave their parents"]],[3134,["at the eighteen years of age? Because, you see, it will be a big loss.”"]],[3138,["I said, “Why?” “Firstly, if I start smoking who will stop me?”"]],[3144,["Such an innocent thing. “If I start smoking,"]],[3148,["only my father can slap me on the face, nobody else."]],[3152,["So he can save me from the smoking.”"]],[3155,["I was amazed at his innocence, the way he was saying that,"]],[3160,["“I want my father to be there to slap me.”"]],[3162,["And then he said, “And then my mother, she’s the one"]],[3166,["who corrects me every point; so if she goes away, if I am not with her,"]],[3171,["who will correct me? Who will tell me don’t do this and don’t do that?”"]],[3175,["I never understood that, look at this boy of sixteen years"]],[3180,["– he’s an Indian – telling me that his parents’ utility is"]],[3184,["that they are the only people who can stop him from doing wrong things!"]],[3190,["Because he was a born-realised and he could see that,"]],[3195,["“if I try to do something wrong it’s only my parents can tell me.”"]],[3200,["So this innocence always seeks [a] virtuous life,"]],[3205,["this better life and it doesn’t assert on others."]],[3211,["But it’s, somehow or other, when there is innocence"]],[3215,["– just like you people are now Self-realised people –"]],[3218,["in the light of your Self, you don’t want to do something"]],[3223,["that is not innocent, that is not simple."]],[3227,["For example, I have never seen such honest people"]],[3230,["as we have in Sahaja Yoga. Absolutely honest, I mean,"]],[3234,["they don’t want to take even a single pie (1/192 Rupee) out of things."]],[3238,["Of course, there have been some horrible people, also,"]],[3241,["who made lots of money out of Sahaj Yog, doesn’t matter;"]],[3244,["but most of you have become so honest."]],[3247,["I mean there’s so much corruption in this world"]],[3250,["and to see people who are so honest."]],[3255,["Now the greatest quality, as you know, of Shri Ganesha’s"]],[3258,["I was told yesterday, that for them their Mother is the most important."]],[3263,["What Mother says and what Mother does, that’s the most important thing."]],[3269,["I mean, it is so much that I really can’t understand"]],[3275,["how you people are so much fond of me."]],[3281,["Because I think that, whatever you think about me mentally"]],[3291,["is nothing compared to what you have within yourself"]],[3294,["and that is Shri Ganesha’s, again, the quality."]],[3298,["Because He’s so attached to me"]],[3300,["that he will fight his Father, he will fight everybody."]],[3304,["That’s what you are."]],[3306,["Anything against me, you cannot tolerate,"]],[3308,["anything wrong said against me you cannot follow."]],[3312,["I have seen people getting furious if somebody said a word against me."]],[3317,["So this quality of love for me is coming from Shri Ganesha within you."]],[3324,["But the another quality, as I said, is that"]],[3327,["He makes the ganas work and so you have to work it out."]],[3332,["Yesterday’s thing has shown me how this collectivity"]],[3338,["of Switzerland has come up so well, so well."]],[3344,["And it was really showing how we can progress. You all have talents."]],[3352,["Not that only Swiss have. You all have talents."]],[3355,["You all have understanding. You are all intelligent."]],[3359,["All of you are special people and you have to work out in collective way"]],[3364,["and also individual way to show your quality of Shri Ganesh,"]],[3370,["the way He has the rhythm within Him."]],[3372,["He’s very rhythmic and yesterday those two big musicians sitting,"]],[3376,["he said, “Mother, they are so rhythmically clapping, they are rhythmic."]],[3382,["There’s no, ‘ha, ha, hoo, hoo,’ just clapping and so rhythmic."]],[3386,["Nobody makes a mistake.”"]],[3388,["Then they said, “When they sing also, nobody’s out of tune.”"]],[3392,["Normally, if ten people are singing, without proper training,"]],[3396,["then this are in alto, tenor, bass, everything, they go on."]],[3400,["And you don’t know on what swar (note) they have taken, on what note they are singing."]],[3405,["But they were yesterday very amazed that all of you were singing on the same note;"]],[3410,["you wouldn’t leave the note and come onto another note."]],[3414,["That shows that the rhythm of Shri Ganesha is working in you"]],[3418,["and His understanding of music, which is one of His qualities is:"]],[3426,["that He dances on the music of which Nataraja, the Father Shiva has taught Him."]],[3438,["It’s very rhythmic. That part, I think, a little bit, Sahaja Yogis are missing:"]],[3443,["that when they dance they need not be, all of them, in [a] very rhythmic pattern."]],[3448,["They’re alright, but still one has to learn [a] little more"]],[3451,["rhythmic pattern, would be a good idea."]],[3454,["As the Shri Ganesha, which is such a big stomach that He has,"]],[3457,["He dances so well, so lightly He lifts his body and the way He works it out, it’s amazing."]],[3464,["How does He do it with such a…and a short person with such thick legs?"]],[3470,["He is very light and the lightness comes because of innocence – Mooladhar."]],[3478,["If the Mooladhara is alright, then lightness is there."]],[3483,["You have seen in Maharashtra how these people were playing the Lezim (dance)"]],[3491,["with such speed and with such lightness:"]],[3497,["they were lifting their legs and hand."]],[3500,["It was really amazing how they were doing it."]],[3506,["And it is only the innocence of these people of the villages"]],[3512,["that they don’t understand much of this nonsense."]],[3516,["They don’t know what is going on with all these things."]],[3520,["They earn their living, they are farmers,"]],[3522,["and then in the evening they just sleep off in complete innocence."]],[3528,["They do not plan, they do not sit down and find out"]],[3532,["how to kill somebody, maybe something how to rob somebody"]],[3540,["or another bad things that people think"]],[3543,["– the bad action that comes into their minds. There is no time for that."]],[3547,["They work the whole day. In the evening, nicely they sleep."]],[3550,["Or else they will have a bhajan mandeley where they will all sing together"]],[3556,["in a very beautiful manner."]],[3558,["So it’s a real sahaj style where we don’t have to think"]],[3564,["about killing anybody or to murder anybody."]],[3567,["Like all these cults, they have weapons with them! I can’t understand."]],[3573,["Even I was told that in Poland our Pope maharaj sent lots of weapons there."]],[3580,["What is the need for anybody who is spiritual to have weapons around"]],[3585,["and think of violence and killing people?"]],[3588,["Because there is no innocence at all. You can see that."]],[3591,["If you are innocent your power is your innocence,"]],[3595,["you don’t have to have weapons and guns and things."]],[3600,["All these religions, so-called, are using nothing but weapons and guns"]],[3606,["and all kinds of killing objects and they are also killed."]],[3610,["It’s a funny thing going on in the name of God, in the name of Shri Ganesh."]],[3616,["There is no need for us to fight."]],[3618,["There is no need for us to think that we’ll kill this man or kill that one."]],[3623,["Only you have to just desire, project your energy"]],[3627,["and you will see [that] the person will disappear."]],[3630,["He’ll either become a transformed person"]],[3633,["or he will not be there to trouble you."]],[3638,["So, one thing I have to again stress is that we must know our qualities"]],[3643,["and our powers."]],[3647,["Many people I know could never come on the stage and speak also."]],[3651,["I said, “You get along – finished! Start it.” It worked out."]],[3657,["Anything, you just project. “I can do it! Why can’t I do it?”"]],[3661,["To say, “I can’t. I am sorry.”"]],[3665,["This ‘sorry’ is so common now."]],[3667,["On the telephone also people will say “sorry”.  I said, “What ‘sorry’?”"]],[3670,["All the time, “sorry, sorry, sorry.”"]],[3672,["We used to say, “I beg your pardon,” – was sensible."]],[3675,["But the way people are, “Poor me, you know. How can I do it?”"]],[3681,["All such people are not yet aware of their powers that they have."]],[3686,["You can do it, everything. You can."]],[3689,["Everything can be managed; after all, you have the power."]],[3693,["In that power you must know that you are not going to do something indiscreet,"]],[3698,["you are not going to spoil anybody,"]],[3701,["but your power itself will show that this power"]],[3706,["is really of love, affection, compassion for the transformation of the whole world."]],[3714,["I am thinking of the complete global transformation,"]],[3717,["which, I know, is a mad dream, but still I think like that,"]],[3723,["because I see you all, then I think you all can do it"]],[3729,["and when I see the Shri Ganesha in you, I am sure it will work out."]],[3737,["So, in my lifetime I have seen so many Sahaj Yogis, all over."]],[3743,["How things are worked out: you have heard about in Brazil"]],[3747,["and also in Argentina, most unexpected."]],[3750,["The people came to a program from twelve o’clock in the morning"]],[3754,["when we were going to have the program at seven o’clock!"]],[3758,["I reached there at about eight, as usual, and they said,"]],[3761,["“Mother, You won’t believe there was a big drama here!”"]],[3764,["I said, “What drama?” “They were sitting here from twelve o’clock,"]],[3767,["so all those who had come earlier got inside,"]],[3770,["but those who came at the last minute would not be allowed"]],[3774,["and they are sitting there and fighting,"]],[3776,["‘No, we are going to come inside somehow!’ ”"]],[3780,["So then, one of the Sahaja Yogis sensibly went and talked to the manager"]],[3784,["and told, “Baba, let them come! There is room.”"]],[3788,["So there were four tiers."]],[3789,["One was the ground, then one more, one more, one more."]],[3793,["When I came I saw, “What’s this?”"]],[3796,["All over, the whole thing was filled with these people."]],[3801,["I had never seen them before, but they were there,"]],[3805,["and so respectful, so much absorbing the vibrations."]],[3814,["And I found it difficult to control my tears out of a real feeling"]],[3820,["of such gratitude for Shri Ganesh."]],[3826,["He’s the one who worked it out."]],[3829,["That’s why they say always,"]],[3830,["“First worship Shri Ganesh before starting any work,”"]],[3834,["because then it gives you that peace,"]],[3837,["that tremendous powerful peace which works out so many things"]],[3843,["that you never thought it would."]],[3849,["So we have to request Shri Ganesha"]],[3854,["that all the problems of our land owning should be solved by Him"]],[3859,["and by your Shri Ganesh power."]],[3862,["We are still hoping to get the land"]],[3864,["and I want to install this properly for you because every time"]],[3868,["I don’t want you to suffer like this."]],[3870,["It’s a pilgrimage, but rather difficult this time you all had,"]],[3875,["but you managed it very nicely and you never showed"]],[3879,["any kind of a reluctance to accept this challenge."]],[3886,["Shri Ganesha was testing you I think also, a little bit."]],[3890,["But all that has worked out so well and now"]],[3893,["we are here to do the puja of Shri Ganesh."]],[3897,["May God Bless you."]]]);
